rom the terrain, Godot gets even more confused and sets the tiles to the image above when painting on the leftmost tile. The leftmost tile does become correct, but the other bottom tiles do not.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP and paint a structure using the TileMapLayer that includes at least an inside corner facing upward (something similar to the pictures above).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[TerrainBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24362587/TerrainBug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}